    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Gehe hehe hehe hehe hehe hehe hehe hehe"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Gufu fufu fufu"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I will be"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Uhehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehe"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Ehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehe"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh, Hachiken- Sun. You finished with club already?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What are you guys doing!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We're cleaning up the cows and getting them ready for the competition."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Com- Peti- Tion?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's like a cow beauty contest. Here, look at this."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh, this is that erotic cow book."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "ero- tic?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hmm... your cow's back looks a bit rounded, don't you think?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh, hold on just a second."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There are a lot of different techniques to show them off the best way possible."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "For example, if you make them stand on slightly higher ground with their front legs like this... see? Now her back looks straight, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Sparkle"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Wow! You're right!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Cutting the hair on their back just right helps make it look straight as well."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "In the spots where their back curves in, you leave the hair longer, and where their back sticks out more, you cut the hair shorter."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Oh, I see."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "straight to"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "hair, and"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So you're just making them look better than they really are."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Huh..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"Holstein                                                            "
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "burst"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Call it commitment to showing how beautiful-ful they can truly be!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It's no different than putting on Makeup!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'm sorry I"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So Bea UTI full !!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You're the best!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "There are always a lot of cows at these competitions, so you have to do whatever you can to make them look better."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "We'll never let any other man ever lay his filthy hands on you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T16",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But even so, just putting on Airs like that doesn't fool the judges."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T17",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I see ..."
    }
